<title>USA: New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Nov 22.</title>
<headline>New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Nov 22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - TBN 55,000-60,000 long tons coal USG/Taiwan 10-23/1 $17.08 fio 5 days shinc Taipower.</p>
<p>Docerno 150,000-10% Newcastle/Rotterdam 1-15/1 $10.35 fio 35,000 shinc/35,000 shinc Bocimar.</p>
<p>TBN 59,000-10% Newcastle/Kaohsiung 18-31/12 $9.20 fio 25,000 shinc/20,000 $9.20 Taipower.</p>
<p>IRON ORE - TBN 110,000-10% long tons Seven Island/Antwerp 5-10/12 $6.50 fio 6 days cnr.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, +1 212-859-1640</p>
